@startuml
title SaveBite Backend — Single Boundary Package Diagram
top to bottom direction
skinparam packageStyle folder
skinparam shadowing false
package "SaveBite.Backend (SaveBite.Api)" {
  package "Controllers" as C
  package "Authorization" as A
  package "Services.Interfaces" as SI
  package "Models.Requests" as Req
  package "Models.Responses" as Res
  package "Filters" as F
  package "Validators" as V
  package "Services.Implementations" as S
  package "Helpers" as H
  package "EmailTemplates" as T
  package "Middlewares" as MW
  package "Exceptions" as EX
  package "Repositories.Interfaces" as RI
  package "Models.DTOs" as DTO
  package "Configurations" as CFG
  package "Caching.Implementations" as K
  package "Caching.Interfaces" as KI
  package "Repositories.Implementations" as R
  package "Models.Entities" as E
  package "Constants" as Const
  package "Messaging" as Q
  package "Messaging.Interfaces" as QI
  package "Data" as D
  package "Models.Enums" as EN
  package "Messaging.Events" as QE
  C ..> SI
  C ..> A
  C ..> Req
  C ..> Res
  A ..> SI
  F ..> Res
  V ..> Req
  MW ..> EX
  S ..> SI
  S ..> RI
  S ..> KI
  S ..> QI
  S ..> QE
  S ..> H
  S ..> T
  S ..> Req
  S ..> Res
  S ..> DTO
  S ..> E
  S ..> CFG
  S ..> EX
  R ..> RI
  R ..> D
  R ..> E
  R ..> Req
  R ..> Res
  R ..> DTO
  K ..> KI
  Q ..> QI
  Q ..> QE
  Q ..> SI
  D ..> E
  D ..> EN
  E ..> EN
  H ..> Const
}
legend bottom
  Một khung ngoài duy nhất; các package bên trong không bao thêm layer.
  A ..> B: dependency trong code; không phải thứ tự request.
  Sơ đồ tổng quan lược bớt cạnh dùng chung.
  Data gộp AppDbContext, Configurations, Migrations, Seed.
  Messaging gộp Publisher, Consumer, Configuration, Constants, Models, Extensions.
  Services.Interfaces gồm interface nghiệp vụ và adapter hạ tầng.
endlegend
@enduml
